========================================================================
jet --help
========================================================================
Usage: jet [options] [command]

Lightning Jet CLI

Options:
  -V, --version                             output the version number
  -v                                        output the version number
  --quiet                                   Quiet mode - only displays warn and error messages
  --verbose                                 Verbose mode - will also output debug messages
  --no-color                                Disable colors
  -h, --help                                display help for command

Commands:
  info [options] [id]                       Prints info about a node (this or another), or a channel
  status [options]                          Shows services status
  start [options] <service>                 Starts a service
  stop [options] <service>                  Stops a service
  restart [options] <service>               Restarts a service
  stats [options]                           Shows channel profitability stats
  probes [options]                          Displays nodes discovered during probes that have signaled a commitment to liquidity
  rebalance [options] <from> <to> <amount>  Rebalances the node via circular rebalance
  pay [options] <request>                   Pay an invoice
  peers [options]                           Lists peers classified into inbound, outbound and balanced based on routing history
  fees [options]                            Lists peer fees
  analyze-fees [options] [node]             Analyzes peer fees
  htlc-history [options] [days]             Prints cumulative HTLC history for peers
  htlc-analyzer [options] [node]            Prints stats about failed HTLCs
  rebalance-history [options] [node]        Lists past rebalances
  list-peers [options]                      Lists peer aliases and ids
  list-channels [options]                   Lists channels: active, inactive and force closing
  monitor [options] [secs]                  Prints information about ongoing rebalances and stuck HTLCs
  fee-history [options] [node]              Prints fee history for a peer
  channel-events [options]                  Lists channel events
  channeldb [options]                       Prints stats about the channel.db
  send-message [options] <node> <message>   Sends a message to a node via keysend
  update-channel [options] <chan>           Updates fees on a channel
  close-channel [options] <chan>            Closes a channel
  reconnect [options]                       Reconnects to disconnected peers
  help [command]                            display help for command

========================================================================
jet info --help
========================================================================
Usage: jet info [options] [id]

Returns various node or channel stats

Arguments:
  id          Node id, node partial alias, or channel id

Options:
  --db        Lists db tables sorted by size
  --os        Prints OS stats (cpu & mem)
  --quiet     Quiet mode - only displays warn and error messages
  --verbose   Verbose mode - will also output debug messages
  --no-color  Disable colors
  -h, --help  display help for command

