  --no-color  Disable colors
  -h, --help  display help for command

========================================================================
jet start --help
========================================================================
Usage: jet start [options] <service>

Starts a service.

Arguments:
  service     Service; use 'all' to start all services (choices: "rebalancer",
              "logger", "daddy", "telegram", "worker", "all")

Options:
  --quiet     Quiet mode - only displays warn and error messages
  --verbose   Verbose mode - will also output debug messages
  --no-color  Disable colors
  -h, --help  display help for command

Services: rebalancer, logger, daddy, telegram, worker


